# BLSS net provenance (docs/neural-upscaler.md). Written beside the net
# it describes; the net's own bytes carry only magic + net-version, so
# everything here is what a consumer needs to know that a net which
# LOADS is also the right net. No timestamp and no editor version on
# purpose - re-running `command` must reproduce this file byte for byte.
blss-provenance 1
net-version 3
features 6
hidden 12
outputs 3
tile 32
act-table 512
scale 2x2
jitter 0
sharpen 0.5
frames 156
shots 6
epochs 400
seed 0xB1557
corpus examples/upscaler-lab
command tyrax-editor --blss-train examples/upscaler-lab --all-shots
